                                                "text": "1998, Laplana, Josep de C., Macià, Teresa, Museu de Montserrat: visitor's guide\nNext to a Catalan revival paten which represents the Adoration of the Kings, there is another which was produced, in 1924, by the Barcelonan metalworker Ramon Sunyer (1889-1963)."
